      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Quick update on this: As of the last several months, OpenComposite no longer seems to work with VRChat (it crashes). As a side effect, this neat waist tracker workaround is no longer viable. Being able to do this natively would be the best way of ensuring this feature is around for the foreseeable future.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
