  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-12T02:21:17.925Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know that at the moment, we can use a third touch controller (Oculus VR object) as a waist tracker via the native SDK in OpenComposite, but this functionality doesn’t seem to be present in the Oculus Store version. Is this something we may see added?",
